### Local database ###
# The H2 database file holds real usernames and password hashes.
# It must never be committed - each student's copy is their own.
data/
*.mv.db
*.trace.db

### Application secrets ###
# Never commit API keys. Set them as environment variables instead (see README).
application-local.properties
.env

